{
  "slug": "harness-sast-and-sca",
  "name": "Harness Sast And Sca",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The Harness SAST and SCA plugin for Claude Code enables Secure AI Coding, bringing real-time security into your AI-assisted development workflow. All AI-generated code is automatically scanned, validated, and remediated as you work.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `scan` (Run local Harness SAST on source files, or SCA on dependency manifests), `update` (Install or update Harness SAST and SCA engine dependencies (analyzers and dependency tooling))\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install harness-sast-and-sca@claude-community` from `ShiftLeftSecurity/claude-plugins` (`plugins/harness-sast-and-sca`).",
